{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification.md","title":"Universal Acceptance Is Recognizable but Undecidable","display":"thm-universal-language-recognizable-undecidable — Universal Acceptance Is Recognizable but Undecidable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification","aliases":["73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification","73-thm-universal-language-recognizable-undecidable"],"display":"thm-universal-language-recognizable-undecidable — Universal Acceptance Is Recognizable but Undecidable","depends_on":["[[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-thm-binary-universal-machine]]","[[73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification</span><span>73-thm-universal-language-recognizable-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-language-recognizable-undecidable — Universal Acceptance Is Recognizable but Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ff60c13bb604c68\" href=\"?note=8ff60c13bb604c68\" title=\"73-df-paired-acceptance-language\">73-df-paired-acceptance-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17b3325184317072\" href=\"?note=17b3325184317072\" title=\"73-thm-binary-universal-machine\">73-thm-binary-universal-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2caf5daca8cda484\" href=\"?note=2caf5daca8cda484\" title=\"73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability\">73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed effective coding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\">\\(A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (universal acceptance language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ff60c13bb604c68\" href=\"?note=8ff60c13bb604c68\" title=\"73-df-paired-acceptance-language\">73-df-paired-acceptance-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (recognizable and decidable binary languages)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}language\\text{-}recognizable\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\in\n\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}language\\text{-}recognizable\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\in\n\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A recognizer first parses the explicit pair code and tests the decidable valid-machine-code range; it rejects malformed inputs and otherwise invokes the universal simulation. Thus it accepts exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\">\\(A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A decider for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\">\\(A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\)</span> would decide the diagonal language: reject ill-formed codes, and on a valid code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(x=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> negate the decider's answer on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>. That contradicts <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2caf5daca8cda484\" href=\"?note=2caf5daca8cda484\" title=\"73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability\">73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-paired-acceptance-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ff60c13bb604c68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-universal-machine","status":"resolved","id":"17b3325184317072","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-universal-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability","status":"resolved","id":"2caf5daca8cda484","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-paired-acceptance-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ff60c13bb604c68","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}$ (universal acceptance language, see [[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability","status":"resolved","id":"2caf5daca8cda484","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"A decider for $A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}$ would decide the diagonal language: reject ill-formed codes, and on a valid code $x=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}$ negate the decider's answer on $\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$. That contradicts [[73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}language\\text{-}recognizable\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\in\n\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":true},{"tex":"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"x=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","display":false}],"bytes":1770,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9cd45cc8e4df82aa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8ff60c13bb604c68","11b19b6d211be8ab","004d4e2ba3fdd14e","17b3325184317072","2caf5daca8cda484"]}